{"updatedAt":"2026-08-04T10:51:10.451Z","createdAt":"2026-08-04T10:21:43.464Z","id":"fL8es8Vf8jdJjfTX","name":"Section 2 - Failure Test","description":null,"active":true,"isArchived":false,"nodes":[{"parameters":{"path":"course/n8n103/failure-test","authentication":"headerAuth","options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.webhook","typeVersion":2.1,"position":[0,0],"id":"98ed8b81-46c9-495f-b5cd-897606ae2fba","name":"TriggerWebhook","webhookId":"17338261-b4b9-40c4-843b-b06f61aa0a10","credentials":{"httpHeaderAuth":{"id":"SnkAOUDJcllkPosL","name":"n8n Academy API Key"}}},{"parameters":{"url":"https://learn.app.n8n.cloud/webhook/course/n8n103/guaranteed-failure","authentication":"genericCredentialType","genericAuthType":"httpHeaderAuth","sendHeaders":true,"headerParameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"X-Assessment-ID ","value":"52635d5b72a6324c894362d240649ce7"}]},"options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":4.4,"position":[208,0],"id":"4c0182d1-de0e-4b25-8924-184b1fcecd4f","name":"CallFailingEndpoint","credentials":{"httpHeaderAuth":{"id":"SnkAOUDJcllkPosL","name":"n8n Academy API Key"}}},{"parameters":{"content":"# Section 2 - Failure Test\n\nOwned By: Jan Wendell Mesia\nLast Updated: Aug 4, 2026\n\nWebhook workflow that intentionally fails to test error workflow\ntriggering. Called by the main Debugging Practice workflow.\n\n## Endpoint\n- GET /webhook/course/n8n103/failure-test\n- Authentication: Header Auth (n8n Academy API Key)\n\n## Flow\n1. TriggerWebhook: Receives request and responds immediately\n2. CallFailingEndpoint: Calls guaranteed-failure endpoint and throws\n3. Execution ends in an unhandled error\n4. Linked Error Workflow (Section 2 - Error Handler) runs\n\n## Error Configuration\n- CallFailingEndpoint left on default On Error (Stop Workflow)\n- Error Workflow linked to Section 2 - Error Handler\n\n## Requirements\n- Must be published for production execution\n- Must have Error Workflow configured in settings\n\nPart of: n8n Foundations Program, N8N103 Course, Section 2","height":992,"width":528},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[-96,-816],"id":"1fb8393b-d5aa-4a63-921c-2b4df589a624","name":"Sticky Note"}],"connections":{"TriggerWebhook":{"main":[[{"node":"CallFailingEndpoint","type":"main","index":0}]]}},"settings":{"executionOrder":"v1","binaryMode":"separate","availableInMCP":false,"timeSavedMode":"fixed","errorWorkflow":"UTn3m3K52QK4UWgk","callerPolicy":"workflowsFromSameOwner"},"staticData":null,"meta":{"templateCredsSetupCompleted":true},"nodeGroups":[],"pinData":{},"versionId":"65df2971-052d-4e88-b56c-dca9be9530ab","activeVersionId":"55b303f3-fb09-4b81-ae83-ef14acea64e3","versionCounter":36,"triggerCount":1,"sourceWorkflowId":null,"tags":[{"updatedAt":"2026-07-28T11:27:34.879Z","createdAt":"2026-07-28T11:27:34.879Z","id":"ffYL0yoxdNLYKHg4","name":"n8n103"}],"shared":[{"updatedAt":"2026-08-04T10:21:43.467Z","createdAt":"2026-08-04T10:21:43.467Z","role":"workflow:owner","workflowId":"fL8es8Vf8jdJjfTX","projectId":"JYyiAQWuJt5wnZhD","project":{"updatedAt":"2026-07-25T19:21:11.253Z","createdAt":"2026-07-25T19:19:13.063Z","id":"JYyiAQWuJt5wnZhD","name":"Jan Wendell Mesia <wendellsmesia@gmail.com>","type":"personal","icon":null,"description":null,"customTelemetryTags":[],"creatorId":"09ff975c-0074-4919-976c-b469d160f9db"}}],"versionMetadata":{"name":null,"description":null}}